    <description>ShortGeek turns a script you write or paste in into a finished vertical short, rendered on your
own machine.

* Paste a script, split into a hook, beats and a call to action
* Narrates it and burns in captions timed word by word
* Attach a small screenshot to any beat
* Renders 1080x1920 MP4, ready to upload to TikTok, Reels or YouTube Shorts
* Backgrounds drawn in code, or your own clips. No AI generated imagery, no account, no watermark

The default Edge voice sends the narration text to Microsoft's online speech service; an offline
voice that sends nothing is also available. Privacy details: https://techygeekshome.info/shortgeek/privacy/

Free to download and use. Python and ffmpeg are inside the installer, so there is nothing to
install first.</description>
    <summary>Free vertical short video maker for Windows, narrated and captioned, on your own machine</summary>
